- No. I do not agree.

57
00:02:18,000 --> 00:02:19,900
- Yeah.

58
00:02:20,070 --> 00:02:23,160
We have come a long way

59
00:02:20,070 --> 00:02:23,160
since the day when we would sit idly by...

60
