78
00:03:45,290 --> 00:03:48,550
- Yes.

79
00:03:45,290 --> 00:03:48,550
- Yes, what?

80
00:03:50,390 --> 00:03:53,120
Yes, Detective Crockett.

81
00:04:00,440 --> 00:04:03,410
