90
00:04:27,800 --> 00:04:30,030
- Can we get started, huh?

91
00:04:27,800 --> 00:04:30,030
- Yes, sir.

92
00:04:30,200 --> 00:04:35,100
Steve Loomis.

93
00:04:30,200 --> 00:04:35,100
Petty larceny and shoplifting.

94
00:04:35,270 --> 00:04:39,110
Your Honor, Mr. Loomis, was arrested

95
00:04:35,270 --> 00:04:39,110
