99
00:04:43,710 --> 00:04:47,270
- Isn't it obvious?

100
00:04:48,820 --> 00:04:51,310
I got a problem.

101
00:04:53,660 --> 00:04:55,520
- Your Honor.

102
00:04:53,660 --> 00:04:55,520
- Yeah?

103
00:04:55,690 --> 00:04:59,650
I suggest you rip open his gullet

104
00:04:55,690 --> 00:04:59,650
