159
00:07:24,710 --> 00:07:26,230
Sorry.

160
00:07:26,410 --> 00:07:27,570
But then on the upside...

161
00:07:27,740 --> 00:07:31,440
...you have managed

162
00:07:27,740 --> 00:07:31,440
