169
00:07:44,760 --> 00:07:46,990
Is this a trick question?

170
00:07:47,930 --> 00:07:50,690
I can't do it, Your Honor.

171
00:07:47,930 --> 00:07:50,690
I just can't do it.

172
00:07:50,870 --> 00:07:52,830
Okay, then take a shower.

173
00:07:53,000 --> 00:07:54,160
