249
00:10:48,410 --> 00:10:51,710
You better believe it.

250
00:10:48,410 --> 00:10:51,710
He took it out of my pocket.

251
00:10:52,180 --> 00:10:55,280
What the hell are you doing

252
00:10:52,180 --> 00:10:55,280
